/-
    Path: {% include '~/Themes/GreaterThingsV1/Assets/Lava/Custom/Features/Dashboard/Base.lava' %}
    Description: Internal Greater Things dashboard. Picks the reporting window out of the persisted
                 dataset, then hands each summary to its own partial.

                 Every figure comes from the greater-things-dashboard persisted dataset, built by
                 PersistedDatasets/dashboard.lava. This page runs no queries and needs no cache: it
                 reads one row, so the block needs no Enabled Lava Commands at all.

                 The window is chosen from a fixed set the dataset publishes, rather than a range
                 typed into the address. A width nobody precomputed cannot be asked for, so there is
                 no range to guard and no custom option.

                 Renders on an internal Rock page, so the theme's Sass never loads and every include
                 needs a full ~/Themes/GreaterThingsV1/ path. A ~~/ path would resolve against the
                 internal page's own theme.

    Parameters:
        None. The window is read from the Days page parameter.

    Provides: Read by the partials out of shared include scope. Each partial lists what it uses.

        dashboardWindow           - The selected window from the dataset. Website, Pages,
                                    SecondaryGoals, Sources and Buttons hang off it.
        dashboardWindowDays       - Width of the selected window in days.
        dashboardWindowOptions    - Every width the dataset carries, for the period bar.
        dashboardRangeLabel       - e.g. "August 22 to September 20, 2026".
        dashboardShortRangeLabel  - e.g. "Aug. 22 - Sep. 20".
        dashboardGeneratedAt      - When the dataset was last built.
-/

//- MARK: Dataset
{% assign dashboardData = 'greater-things-dashboard' | PersistedDataset %}

{% assign dashboardWindowItems = dashboardData.Windows %}
{% assign dashboardWindowOptions = dashboardData.AvailableWindows %}
{% assign dashboardGeneratedAt = dashboardData.GeneratedAt %}

/-
    MARK: Window
    The parameter is compared as a number rather than handed to Where, because it arrives off the
    query string as text and the dataset stores the width as an integer.
-/
{% assign dashboardRequestedDays = 'Global' | PageParameter:'Days' | AsInteger %}

{% if dashboardRequestedDays == 0 %}
    {% assign dashboardRequestedDays = dashboardData.DefaultWindowDays | AsInteger %}
{% endif %}

{% assign dashboardWindow = null %}

{% for dashboardWindowRow in dashboardWindowItems %}
    {% assign dashboardRowDays = dashboardWindowRow.WindowDays | AsInteger %}

    {% if dashboardRowDays == dashboardRequestedDays %}
        {% assign dashboardWindow = dashboardWindowRow %}
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

//- A width nobody precomputed falls back to the default rather than erroring. The period bar only
//- ever links to widths the dataset published, so this is a hand edited address.
{% if dashboardWindow == null %}
    {% assign dashboardWindow = dashboardWindowItems | First %}
{% endif %}

/-
    Coerced, because the period bar names the window with a case on this number and marks the chosen
    pill by comparing against it. Whether the dataset's integer arrives as one is the deserializer's
    business, not something the label should depend on.
-/
{% assign dashboardWindowDays = dashboardWindow.WindowDays | AsInteger %}
{% assign dashboardRangeLabel = dashboardWindow.RangeLabel %}
{% assign dashboardShortRangeLabel = dashboardWindow.ShortRangeLabel %}

//- MARK: Assets
{{ '~/Themes/GreaterThingsV1/Assets/Lava/Custom/Features/Dashboard/dashboard.css' | AddCssLink }}

//- MARK: Markup
<div class="dashboard">

    {% if dashboardWindow == null %}
        <div class="alert alert-warning">
            The dashboard dataset has not been built yet. Refresh <strong>greater-things-dashboard</strong>
            under Admin Tools &gt; System Settings &gt; Persisted Datasets.
        </div>
    {% else %}
        {% include '~/Themes/GreaterThingsV1/Assets/Lava/Custom/Features/Dashboard/Partials/Filters.lava' %}
        {% include '~/Themes/GreaterThingsV1/Assets/Lava/Custom/Features/Dashboard/Partials/WebsiteSummary.lava' %}
        {% include '~/Themes/GreaterThingsV1/Assets/Lava/Custom/Features/Dashboard/Partials/InteractionSummary.lava' %}
    {% endif %}

</div>

//- MARK: Script
<script>
    (function () {
        if (!window.jQuery || !jQuery.fn.tooltip) return;

        jQuery('.js-rank-tooltip').tooltip({
            container: 'body',
            html: true,
            template: '<div class="tooltip rank-tooltip" role="tooltip"><div class="tooltip-arrow"></div><div class="tooltip-inner"></div></div>'
        });
    })();
</script>
